        <briefdescription>
<para>Run lint checks on a workspace and return diagnostic findings. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Checks:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Orphan pages (no inbound links)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Missing backlinks</para>
